  "overview": "ByteDance Arco Design — Crisp light (#FFF) canvas, NunitoSans-Bold typography, #ff7d00 brand accent, and 4px corner geometry",
  "dos": "- **Surface & Theme Polarity**: Crisp light (#FFF) canvas paired with `#FFF` component surfaces and `#0b0b0c` primary ink.\n- **Brand & Interactive Accent**: Primary actions and focus states anchor on `#ff7d00` with `#0b0b0c` label contrast.\n- **Typographic Voice**: Headings and UI controls set in `NunitoSans-Bold` across 37 type steps.\n- **Component Geometry**: Buttons (`4px`), cards (`8px`), inputs, badges, and navigation bars share consistent spacing and border contrast."
